OL,3,GNEWSASpecial needs school plans move to
OL,4,A#2.65m site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school for children and young people
OL,7,Fwith special educational needs and
OL,8,Fdisabilities (SEND) could move to a
OL,9,Fformer college campus bought by city
OL,10,Fchiefs for #2.65m.
OL,12,FSunderland City Council has acquired
OL,13,FSunderland College's former building in
OL,14,FWashington and wants to relocate the
OL,15,FBarbara Priestman Academy to the site
OL,16,Feight miles away from the current
OL,17,Fschool.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
