OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASpecial needs school plans move to
OL,4,A#2.65m site
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe school, which caters for 11 to
OL,7,F19-year-olds with autism and complex
OL,8,Flearning difficulties, has outgrown its
OL,9,Fcurrent location, the local authority
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FAny move would be subject to a
OL,13,Ffour-week statutory consultation and
OL,14,Fapproval from the Department for
OL,15,FEducation.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
